🧪 1. REAL BUG WALKTHROUGH (IDOR — Most Common Beginner Win)
🎯 Scenario: Profile API

You log into a site and open DevTools → Network

You see this request:

GET /api/user?id=123
🧠 Step 1: Think Like an Attacker

Ask:

“Is this ID tied to MY account only?”
“What if I change it?”
🔁 Step 2: Modify the Request (Burp Repeater)

Change:

GET /api/user?id=124
